OL,3,GNEWSADementia patients put at risk of
OL,4,Aharm by care firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA home care provider has been placed in
OL,7,Fspecial measures after inspectors found
OL,8,Ffailings that put vulnerable people at
OL,9,Frisk of harm.
OL,11,FClarity Homecare Wolverhampton was
OL,12,Frated inadequate overall by the Care
OL,13,FQuality Commission (CQC) after
OL,14,Finspectors found the provider breached
OL,15,Fregulations relating to safe care and
OL,16,Ftreatment, safeguarding, staff training
OL,17,Fand overall management of the service.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
