OL,3,GNEWSADementia patients put at risk of
OL,4,Aharm by care firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe watchdog, which carried out an
OL,7,Finspection in September, raised
OL,8,Fconcerns about the way risks were
OL,9,Fmanaged and found no evidence that
OL,10,Fpeople's needs had always been properly
OL,11,Fassessed before care was delivered.
OL,13,FDespite the concerns, people using the
OL,14,Fservice spoke positively about the care
OL,15,Fprovided by staff.
